<title>USA: General Employment sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>General Employment sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Employment Enterprises Inc said it declared a stock dividend equal to 15 percent of the outstanding common shares of the corporation, to shareholders of record at the close of business on October 10 to be payable on November 1.</p>
<p>The company said it previously declared 15 percent stock dividends in September 1994 and September 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;We are expecting a strong performance for the company's fourth quarter ending September 30,&quot; said Herb Imhoff, chairman of the staffing services firm.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
